cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software or its results, please cite the article below.
title: Automated Structured Pre-Report Generation for Nephrolithiasis on Non-Contrast CT
abstract: >-
  A hybrid CNN-Transformer framework that generates structured preliminary radiology
  reports for kidney stones from non-contrast CT. Kidneys are localized automatically,
  the kidney is the modelling unit, and stone presence, size class and intrarenal zone
  are assembled into a report by a deterministic invertible template engine.
